<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Singapore stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Singapore stock market is closed on Monday for a holiday. The market will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The key Straits Times Industrials Index ended on Friday at 2,117.23, up 14.50 points from the previous day.</p>
<p>Market turnover reached 129.5 million shares, with gainers outpacing losers by 218 to 104.</p>
<p>-- Rene Pastor (65 8703080)</p>
